§ T27 : IR-OPTIMIZATION-PASSES ← pass-manager + core-opts FULL-OPTIMAL
  W! PhD-grade ← Apocky-directive
  W! SMT-verified-IR enables aggressive-opts safely

§§ DESIGN-PILLARS
  a pass-manager infrastructure ← pluggable pipeline
  b core-opts ← const-fold + DCE + CSE + inline + partial-eval
  c analysis-passes ← dominance + use-def + alias + escape
  d SMT-informed opts ← use refinements to prune branches
  e fixpoint-iteration ← apply until no-change
  f pass-ordering heuristics ← traditional compiler-wisdom
  g per-pass verification ← ir_verify re-run after each
  h opt-level knob ← -O0 -O1 -O2 -O3 semantics
  i pass-statistics ← per-pass counters (applied/skipped)

§§ FILES-NEW
  parser/pass.odin              ~400-LOC  Pass interface + manager
    Pass struct { name, kind, requires[], preserves[], run }
    PassManager { pipeline, scheduler, stats }
    run_pipeline(module, opt_level) → module + stats
  parser/analysis.odin          ~600-LOC  analysis-infrastructure
    dominance_tree(fn) → DomTree
    use_def_chains(fn) → UseDef
    alias_analysis(fn) → AliasInfo
    escape_analysis(fn) → EscapeInfo
  parser/opt_const_fold.odin    ~400-LOC  constant-folding pass
    fold cslv3.add/sub/mul/div/... when all-operands-const
    propagate constants through records + variants
    SMT-assisted : if refinement narrows to single-value, fold
  parser/opt_dce.odin           ~300-LOC  dead-code-elimination
    remove ops with no-used-results + no-side-effects
    region-sensitive : branches with always-false cond
  parser/opt_cse.odin           ~400-LOC  common-subexpression-elimination
    hash-cons ops within dominance-scope
    preserve type + effect-row
  parser/opt_inline.odin        ~500-LOC  function-inlining
    cost-model : size + call-site-frequency + profitability
    alpha-rename to avoid capture
    iterative until fixpoint or budget-exhausted
  parser/opt_partial_eval.odin  ~500-LOC  partial-evaluation
    specialize ops with some-args-const
    driven by @staged-style annotations (future)
    Futamura-P1 for CSLv3-IR contexts
  parser/opt_smt_prune.odin     ~400-LOC  SMT-informed branch-pruning
    query solver : "is branch-cond ever-true under refinements?"
    unreachable-branch → DCE
    always-taken → fold
  parser/pass_driver.odin       ~300-LOC  pipeline-config + stats-report
    default pipelines per opt-level
    JSON + textual stats output
  tests/test_pass.odin          ~300-LOC  Odin unit-tests per-pass
  tests/test_opt_integration.py ~400-LOC  end-to-end pipelines
  tests/opt_fixtures/           input+expected-golden per-pass

§§ PASS-PIPELINE (default -O2)
  1 early-dce + early-const-fold (cleanup)
  2 analysis : dominance + use-def
  3 cse (exploit dominance)
  4 const-fold (after cse exposes constants)
  5 smt-prune (use refinements to drop branches)
  6 dce (remove pruned + unused)
  7 inline (with cost-model + fuel)
  8 const-fold + dce (cleanup after inline)
  9 partial-eval (opportunistic)
  10 final dce + verify

§§ OPT-LEVELS
  -O0 : no-opts • for-debugging-IR
  -O1 : const-fold + dce only
  -O2 : +cse + inline + smt-prune (default)
  -O3 : +partial-eval + aggressive-inline + fixpoint-iterate

§§ CLI-SURFACE
  parser --ir --opt=O2 <file>         → optimized IR
  parser --ir --opt=O3 --stats <file> → + pass-statistics
  parser --ir --opt=O2 --verify-each  → run verifier after each pass
  parser --ir --opt=custom --passes=cse,dce,fold
  parser --ir --opt=O2 --json <file>  → machine-readable
  parser --opt-selftest                → run pass-selftest

§§ SEVERITY-INTEGRATION
  pass-failed-verification  : always-E (opt-bug)
  opt-level-downshift       : W (requested -O3 • gave -O2 reason)
  pass-budget-exhausted     : W (inline-budget hit)
  analysis-imprecision      : I (alias unknown-for this-op)
  diagnostic-codes : CSL-E-500..599 + CSL-W-500..599 + CSL-I-500..599

§§ GOLDEN-OPT-DUMPS
  per-C-corpus : *.O0.ir.txt + *.O1.ir.txt + *.O2.ir.txt + *.O3.ir.txt
  CI-diff per-level
  update explicit only ← prevents silent regression

§§ ACCEPTANCE (T27)
  ✓ 7/7 C-corpus optimizes clean at all opt-levels
  ✓ deliberate-bug fixtures : opts preserve semantics
  ✓ pass-manager stats report correct apply/skip counts
  ✓ SMT-prune uses T26 infrastructure successfully
