§ THEORETICAL-NOTES ← §§ T27-depth-hints
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Pass-manager design :
    LLVM : legacy + new pass-manager • complex
    MLIR : recursive-nested pass-managers • cleaner
    Cranelift : flat-linear • simpler
    recommend MLIR-style ∵ matches T21 nested-regions
  Analysis-preservation :
    passes declare requires + preserves
    manager invalidates non-preserved analyses
    recommend explicit-declaration ∵ avoids bugs
  SSA-based optimizations :
    const-fold trivial in SSA
    DCE : mark-reachable + sweep
    CSE : value-numbering over dominance-tree
    inline : α-rename + splice
  SMT-informed opts :
    query-per-branch : expensive but precise
    cache-obligations : amortize
    recommend : only for high-value branches (hot-path heuristic)
  Termination :
    inline : budget-counter + fixpoint
    partial-eval : fuel + call-depth-limit
    recommend : hard-budgets + W-diag on hit
  Golden-diff strategy :
    per-opt-level golden dumps
    triple : O0 + O1 + O2 baseline
    O3 can-drift but O2 must-be-stable

